		<title>Nepal government approves World Bank earthquake cat bond mandate agreement</title>
		<link>https://www.artemis.bm/news/nepal-government-approves-world-bank-earthquake-cat-bond-mandate-agreement/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=nepal-government-approves-world-bank-earthquake-cat-bond-mandate-agreement</link>
		
