		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.artemis.bm/?p=150820</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>This content is copyright to <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.artemis.bm</a> and should not appear anywhere else, or an infringement has occurred.</p>
<p>According to reports from Nepalese news sources, the country’s government Council of Ministers has approved signing a Mandate Agreement for the Nepal Earthquake Catastrophe Bond project with the World Bank. Back in July, we reported that the World Bank had begun working on a proposed project to deliver a parametric earthquake catastrophe bond for Nepal, [&#8230;]</p>
<p><a href="https://www.artemis.bm/news/nepal-government-approves-world-bank-earthquake-cat-bond-mandate-agreement/">Nepal government approves World Bank earthquake cat bond mandate agreement</a> was published by: <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.Artemis.bm</a><br />
