<p>The severe storm outbreak that impacted Southern Ontario, including Toronto, on September 2nd and 3rd, 2026, is estimated to have resulted in an insurance industry loss of CAD $563 million, according to CatIQ, Canada’s insured loss and exposure indices provider. This is just an initial insurance industry loss estimate from CatIQ as well, meaning there [&#8230;]</p>
<p><a href="https://www.artemis.bm/news/southern-ontario-severe-storm-outbreak-industry-loss-initially-estimated-c563m-by-catiq/">Southern Ontario severe storm outbreak industry loss initially estimated C$563m by CatIQ</a> was published by: <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.Artemis.bm</a><br />
