					<description><![CDATA[<p>This content is copyright to <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.artemis.bm</a> and should not appear anywhere else, or an infringement has occurred.</p>
<p>Our latest video features the second panel discussion of the day at our recent Artemis London 2026 catastrophe bond and insurance-linked securities conference, a session focused on catastrophe bonds and what the current state of the market means for investor, ILS investment manager and sponsor discipline. Our Artemis London 2026 conference, the fifth in the [&#8230;]</p>
<p><a href="https://www.artemis.bm/news/from-hard-market-to-normalisation-cat-bond-discipline-in-practice-artemis-london-2026-video/">From hard market to normalisation &#8211; Cat bond discipline in practice: Artemis London 2026 video</a> was published by: <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.Artemis.bm</a><br />
