					<description><![CDATA[<p>This content is copyright to <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.artemis.bm</a> and should not appear anywhere else, or an infringement has occurred.</p>
<p>Interactive Brokers’ ForecastEx platform has partnered with Reask, the catastrophe modelling and climate analytics specialist, which will see Reask supply settlement data for its live hurricane contracts, enabling capital providers to enter and exit live catastrophe exposure in real time. Interactive Brokers’ ForecastEx platform, allows investors to buy ‘yes’ or ‘no’ contracts based on stated [&#8230;]</p>
<p><a href="https://www.artemis.bm/news/reask-to-provide-settlement-data-for-interactive-brokers-forecastex-live-hurricane-contracts/">Reask to provide settlement data for Interactive Brokers’ ForecastEx live hurricane contracts</a> was published by: <a href="https://www.artemis.bm">www.Artemis.bm</a><br />
